<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="TrampoBom" />
  <meta name="keywords" content="TrampoBom" />
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />

  <title>TrampoBom | Destaque-se dos concorrentes</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Lato:300,400,400i,700,700i" rel="stylesheet">

  <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/css/bootstrap.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/css/main.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com/font-awesome/4.7.0/css/font-awesome.min.css">
</head>

<body>

<header id="login-page">
	<nav class="navbar navbar-default navbar-expand-lg navbar-light">
		<div class="navbar-header d-flex col">
			<a class="navbar-brand" href="#">Trampo<b>BOM</b></a>  		
			<button type="button" data-target="#navbarCollapse" data-toggle="collapse" class="navbar-toggle navbar-toggler ml-auto">
				<span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
				<span class="icon-bar"></span>
				<span class="icon-bar"></span>
				<span class="icon-bar"></span>
			</button>
		</div>
		<div id="navbarCollapse" class="collapse navbar-collapse justify-content-start">
			<ul class="nav navbar-nav navbar-right ml-auto">			
				<li class="nav-item">
					<form method="POST" action="/auth/login">
					<div class="form-row">
						<div class="col">
							<input type="text" class="form-control" placeholder="E-mail" required="required" name="login_email">
						</div>
						<div class="col">
							<input type="password" class="form-control" placeholder="Senha" required="required" name="login_password">
						</div>
						<button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Login</button>
					</div>
					</form>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</nav>
</header>
<div class="landing-home">
  <div class="container wrapper">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-6">
          <div class="intro-texts">
            <h1 class="text-white">Conquiste a posição tão sonhada!!!</h1>
            <p>Crie curriculos incríveis totalmente de graça com a TrampoBom!</p>
			<p>Exporte-os para .pdf de forma totalmente gratuita, sem enganação e propagandas ou 
				Disponibilize seu currículo on-line se preferir.
			</p>
			<p>Seja indicado por amigos com o nosso programa de indicação</p>
			<p>Ajudamos HeadHunter`s a te encontrar!</p>
			<p>Está esperando o que? Se cadastre e boa sorte!</p>
          </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-sm-6 col-sm-offset-1">
		  <div class="reg-form-container">
			  <div class="row">
				  <img src="/images/logo.png" class="margin-zero"/>
				  <div class="col-md-12">
 						<h3>Cadastre-se Agora!!!</h3>
						 <p class="text-muted">Quer algo novo da sua carreira? Nós podemos te ajudar.</p>
				  </div>
			  </div>
				<form class="form-registration" method="POST" action="/auth/register">
					<div class="form-row">
						<div class="col">
							<input type="text" class="form-control" placeholder="Nome" name="reg_first_name" required>
						</div>
						<div class="col">
							<input type="text" class="form-control" placeholder="Sobrenome" name="reg_last_name" required>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="form-row">
						<div class="col">
							<input type="email" class="form-control" placeholder="E-mail" name="reg_email" required>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="form-row">
						<div class="col">
							<input type="password" class="form-control" placeholder="Senha" name="reg_password" required>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="form-row">
						<p class="birth"><strong>Data de Aniversário</strong></p>
						<br></br>
						<div class="col">
							<input type="number" class="form-control" placeholder="Dia" name="reg_day">
						</div>
						<div class="col">
							<input type="number" class="form-control" placeholder="Mes" name="reg_month">
						</div>
						<div class="col">
							<input type="number" class="form-control" placeholder="Ano" name="reg_year">
						</div>
					</div>
					<button class="btn btn-primary">Cadastrar Agora!</button>
				</form>
				<div class="or-seperator"><b>ou</b></div>
				<div class="row">
					<div class="col-sm-12 col-sm-offset-6">
						<ul class="list-inline social-icons">
							<li>
								<a href="#">
									<i class="fa fa-facebook"></i>
								</a>
							</li>
							<li>
								<a href="#">
									<i class="fa fa-linkedin"></i>
								</a>
							</li>
							<li>
								<a href="#">
									<i class="fa fa-google"></i>
								</a>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
		  </div>
      </div>
    </div>
	<div class="row">
		<div class="col-sm-6 col-sm-offset-6">
			 {{#if errors}}
          		<p class="text-white">Ops! Tivemos um problema: {{ errors }}</p>
        	{{/if}}
		</div>
	</div>
  </div>
</div>

  <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.4.1.slim.min.js"
    integrity="sha384-J6qa4849blE2+poT4WnyKhv5vZF5SrPo0iEjwBvKU7imGFAV0wwj1yYfoRSJoZ+n"
    crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
  <script src="/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
  <script>
    $(document).on("click", ".navbar-right .dropdown-menu", function(e){
		  e.stopPropagation();
	  });
  </script>
</body>

</html>